When generating commit messages and git commit, you MUST ALWAYS use Simplified Chinese (简体中文).

Use these prefixes:
- 修复: for bug fixes
- 新增: for new features  
- 优化: for performance improvements
- 重构: for code refactoring
- 文档: for documentation
- 测试: for tests
- 样式: for formatting

Examples:
- "修复: 每日温度单调栈逻辑错误"
- "优化: 链表中间结点实现"

IMPORTANT: All commit messages MUST be in Chinese!
